// Tunneling Tool Execution | T1041, T1071.001, T1572 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules-threat-hunting/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_exfil_and_tunneling_tool_execution.yml
any where process.executable.caseless like~ ("*\\httptunnel.exe", "*\\plink.exe", "*\\socat.exe", "*\\stunnel.exe")
